---
import config from "@/config/config.json";

const { site } = config;
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Download Aethis - Free Guitar Amp Simulator</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Download Aethis for macOS or Windows. Professional guitar processing with three amplifiers, 4-voice harmonizer, and complete effects chain. Free to use." />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      :root {
        --color-primary: #D76D77;
        --color-body: #ffffff;
        --color-text: #666666;
        --color-heading: #1a1a1a;
        --color-border: #e5e5e5;
        --color-card-bg: #f8f8f8;
      }

      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
        background: var(--color-body);
        color: var(--color-heading);
        min-height: 100vh;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 24px;
      }

      /* Header */
      header {
        padding: 24px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      }

      header .container {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--color-heading);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      nav {
        display: flex;
        gap: 32px;
        align-items: center;
      }

      nav a {
        color: var(--color-text);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        transition: color 0.2s;
      }

      nav a:hover {
        color: var(--color-heading);
      }

      /* Hero */
      .hero {
        padding: 100px 0 60px;
        text-align: center;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, #f8f8f8 100%);
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        color: var(--color-heading);
      }

      .hero h1 span {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, #ffca7b 100%);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        color: var(--color-text);
        max-width: 550px;
        margin: 0 auto 24px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .version-tag {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, #ffca7b 100%);
        color: white;
        padding: 8px 20px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }

      .release-link {
        margin-top: 24px;
      }

      .release-link a {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: opacity 0.2s;
      }

      .release-link a:hover {
        opacity: 0.8;
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      .beta-notice {
        margin-top: 32px;
        padding: 20px 28px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1) 0%, rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.05) 100%);
        border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3);
        border-radius: 12px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
        text-align: left;
      }

      .beta-badge {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #22c55e 0%, #16a34a 100%);
        color: white;
        padding: 6px 12px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .beta-notice p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--color-text);
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      /* Donate Section */
      .donate-section {
        padding: 60px 0;
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, #fdf2f4 100%);
      }

      .donate-card {
        max-width: 500px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 40px;
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 20px;
        border: 2px dashed var(--color-primary);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(215, 109, 119, 0.1);
      }

      .donate-icon {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .donate-card h2 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        color: var(--color-heading);
      }

      .donate-card p {
        color: var(--color-text);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .donate-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 14px 28px;
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
        color: var(--color-text);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-radius: 10px;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        cursor: not-allowed;
        opacity: 0.8;
      }

      /* Download Cards */
      .download-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
        gap: 24px;
        max-width: 700px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .download-card {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 36px 28px;
        text-align: center;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
      }

      .download-card:hover {
        border-color: var(--color-primary);
        transform: translateY(-4px);
        box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(215, 109, 119, 0.12);
      }

      .download-card .icon {
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
        margin: 0 auto 20px;
        color: var(--color-heading);
      }

      .download-card h3 {
        font-size: 1.4rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
        color: var(--color-heading);
      }

      .download-card .version {
        color: var(--color-text);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .download-card .formats {
        color: var(--color-text);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .download-count {
        color: var(--color-text);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        min-height: 1.2em;
      }

      .download-count:empty {
        display: none;
      }

      .total-downloads {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .total-downloads:empty {
        display: none;
      }

      .download-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: var(--color-primary);
        color: white;
        padding: 14px 28px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        transition: all 0.2s;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .download-btn:hover {
        filter: brightness(1.08);
        transform: scale(1.02);
      }

      .download-btn.disabled {
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
        color: var(--color-text);
        cursor: not-allowed;
        pointer-events: none;
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      }

      .download-btn-secondary {
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-primary);
        margin-top: 10px;
      }

      .download-btn-secondary:hover {
        background: rgba(215, 109, 119, 0.08);
      }

      .install-notice {
        margin-top: 16px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--color-text);
        line-height: 1.5;
        text-align: left;
      }

      .install-notice summary {
        cursor: pointer;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--color-heading);
        padding: 6px 0;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
      }

      .install-notice summary:hover {
        color: var(--color-primary);
      }

      .install-notice p {
        margin: 6px 0;
      }

      .install-notice ul {
        margin: 6px 0 6px 16px;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .coming-soon-container {
        margin-top: 40px;
        padding: 40px;
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
        border-radius: 20px;
        border: 2px dashed var(--color-primary);
        display: inline-block;
        max-width: 400px;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .coming-soon-container p {
        margin: 0;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }

      /* Security Notice */
      .security-notice {
        display: flex;
        gap: 16px;
        background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.1);
        border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.3);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 20px 24px;
        margin-top: 24px;
        text-align: left;
        max-width: 700px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
      }

      .security-icon {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        color: #d97706;
        margin-top: 2px;
      }

      .security-content h3 {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--color-heading);
        margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      }

      .security-content p {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--color-text);
        margin: 0 0 12px 0;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      .security-content ul {
        margin: 0 0 12px 0;
        padding-left: 20px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--color-text);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .security-content li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }

      .security-content .security-note {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--color-text);
        opacity: 0.8;
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      /* Patch Notes */
      .patch-notes-section {
        padding: 80px 0;
        background: #fff;
      }

      .patch-notes-section h2 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        color: var(--color-heading);
      }

      .patch-notes-section h2 span {
        color: var(--color-text);
      }

      .patch-notes-section > .container > p {
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--color-text);
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }

      .patch-notes-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
        gap: 24px;
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .patch-note-card {
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 24px;
      }

      .patch-note-card h3 {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        color: var(--color-primary);
      }

      .patch-note-card ul {
        list-style: none;
        color: var(--color-text);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .patch-note-card li {
        position: relative;
        padding-left: 16px;
      }

      .patch-note-card li::before {
        content: "•";
        color: var(--color-primary);
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      /* Formats */
      .formats-section {
        padding: 80px 0;
        text-align: center;
        background: #fff;
      }

      .formats-section h2 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        color: var(--color-heading);
      }

      .formats-section h2 span {
        color: var(--color-text);
      }

      .formats-section > p {
        color: var(--color-text);
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }

      .format-badges {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 12px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .format-badge {
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        padding: 10px 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--color-heading);
      }

      /* Requirements */
      .requirements {
        padding: 80px 0;
        background: var(--color-card-bg);
      }

      .requirements h2 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 48px;
        color: var(--color-heading);
      }

      .requirements h2 span {
        color: var(--color-text);
      }

      .req-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
        gap: 24px;
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .req-card {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 28px;
      }

      .req-card h3 {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        color: var(--color-primary);
      }

      .req-card ul {
        list-style: none;
        color: var(--color-text);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        line-height: 1.9;
      }

      .req-card li::before {
        content: "✓";
        color: var(--color-primary);
        margin-right: 10px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      /* Footer */
      footer {
        padding: 32px 0;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--color-text);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        background: #fff;
      }

      footer a {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      footer a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        nav {
          gap: 20px;
        }

        .hero {
          padding: 60px 0 40px;
        }

        .download-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="container">
        <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL} class="logo">Aethis</a>
        <nav>
          <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>Home</a>
          <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}features/amplifiers/`}>Features</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
          <h1>Download <span>Aethis</span></h1>
          <p>Professional guitar processing with three amplifiers, 4-voice harmonizer, and a complete effects chain. Free to download and use.</p>

          <div class="version-tag">v0.1.0 Alpha</div>
          <p class="total-downloads" id="total-downloads"></p>

          <div class="download-grid">
            <div class="download-card">
              <div class="icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                  <path d="M18.71 19.5C17.88 20.74 17 21.95 15.66 21.97C14.32 22 13.89 21.18 12.37 21.18C10.84 21.18 10.37 21.95 9.09997 22C7.78997 22.05 6.79997 20.68 5.95997 19.47C4.24997 17 2.93997 12.45 4.69997 9.39C5.56997 7.87 7.12997 6.91 8.81997 6.88C10.1 6.86 11.32 7.75 12.11 7.75C12.89 7.75 14.37 6.68 15.92 6.84C16.57 6.87 18.39 7.1 19.56 8.82C19.47 8.88 17.39 10.1 17.41 12.63C17.44 15.65 20.06 16.66 20.09 16.67C20.06 16.74 19.67 18.11 18.71 19.5ZM13 3.5C13.73 2.67 14.94 2.04 15.94 2C16.07 3.17 15.6 4.35 14.9 5.19C14.21 6.04 13.07 6.7 11.95 6.61C11.8 5.46 12.36 4.26 13 3.5Z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3>macOS</h3>
              <p class="version">Universal (Intel + Apple Silicon)</p>
              <p class="formats">VST3, AU, Standalone</p>
              <p class="download-count" id="macos-count"></p>
              <a
                href="https://github.com/agastyajindal/aethis/releases/download/0.1.0-alpha/Aethis-0.1.0-alpha-macos-setup.dmg"
                class="download-btn"
                id="macos-download"
                data-platform="macos"
              >
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/>
                  <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/>
                  <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/>
                </svg>
                Download .dmg
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="download-card">
              <div class="icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                  <path d="M3 5.5L10.5 4.5V11.5H3V5.5ZM3 18.5L10.5 19.5V12.5H3V18.5ZM11.5 19.7L21 21V12.5H11.5V19.7ZM11.5 4.3V11.5H21V3L11.5 4.3Z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3>Windows</h3>
              <p class="version">Windows 10/11 (64-bit)</p>
              <p class="formats">VST3, Standalone</p>
              <p class="download-count" id="windows-count"></p>
              <a
                href="https://github.com/agastyajindal/aethis/releases/download/0.1.0-alpha/Aethis-0.1.0-alpha-Windows-Setup.exe"
                class="download-btn"
                id="windows-download"
                data-platform="windows"
              >
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/>
                  <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/>
                  <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/>
                </svg>
                Download .exe
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="release-link">
            <a href="https://github.com/agastyajindal/aethis/releases/tag/0.1.0-alpha" target="_blank">View release on GitHub</a>
          </p>

          <div class="security-notice">
            <div class="security-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
                <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/>
                <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="security-content">
              <h3>You'll see a security warning</h3>
              <p>Aethis isn't signed with an official certificate, so your computer will show a warning when you try to open it. This is normal for indie software — here's how to proceed:</p>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>macOS:</strong> You'll see "Aethis can't be opened because Apple cannot check it for malicious software." Go to <strong>System Settings → Privacy & Security</strong> and click <strong>"Open Anyway"</strong>.</li>
                <li><strong>Windows:</strong> You'll see "Windows protected your PC" from SmartScreen. Click <strong>"More info"</strong> then <strong>"Run anyway"</strong>.</li>
              </ul>
              <p class="security-note">Signing certificates cost several hundred dollars per year. Since Aethis is free during the pre-release phase, it's distributed unsigned. The code is open for review on GitHub.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="beta-notice">
            <span class="beta-badge">ALPHA</span>
            <p>This is an alpha release. Free to use with full features. Report issues on <a href="https://github.com/agastyajindal/aethis/issues">GitHub</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="donate-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="donate-card">
            <div class="donate-icon">
              <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h2>Support the Developer</h2>
            <p>Enjoying Aethis? If you'd like to support continued development and help bring new features to life, donations will be available soon.</p>
            <button class="donate-btn" disabled>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/>
              </svg>
              Donate — Coming Soon
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="patch-notes-section">
        <div class="container">
          <h2>What's New in <span>v0.1.0 Alpha</span></h2>
          <p>First public release — a complete redesign from the ground up.</p>

          <div class="patch-notes-grid">
            <div class="patch-note-card">
              <h3>Total Redesign</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Brand new GPU-accelerated Aethis Engine</li>
                <li>Beautiful floral amp designs with 3D-rendered graphics</li>
                <li>Responsive layout that scales to any window size</li>
                <li>Dark theme optimized for studio use</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="patch-note-card">
              <h3>Three Amp Models</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Rosaria — warm mids, smooth breakup for blues/rock</li>
                <li>Lumina — crystal cleans with maximum headroom</li>
                <li>Noctis — tight, aggressive high-gain for metal</li>
                <li>All powered by Neural Amp Modeler (NAM)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="patch-note-card">
              <h3>4-Voice Harmonizer</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Four independent pitch-shifted voices (±15 semitones)</li>
                <li>Intelligent scale quantization with 8 scale types</li>
                <li>Per-voice level, pan, detune, and delay</li>
                <li>MIDI mode for chord-following harmonies</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="patch-note-card">
              <h3>Complete Effects Chain</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Pre-FX: Boost, Noise Gate, Compressor, Overdrive</li>
